+"""Dashboard authentication: gate engagement and middleware (``gate``), the loopback session token
+(``token``), the shared public allowlist (``public_paths``), the Host guard (``host_guard``),
+login providers (``providers``, ``basic``, ``oidc``, ``service_bearer``), cookies (``cookies``),
+the audit log (``audit``) and reverse-proxy rules (``proxy``). See P18-02 to P18-05."""
